{"speciesId":412,"names":{"fr":"Cheniti","es":"Burmy","en":"Burmy","ja":"ミノムッチ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"To shelter itself from cold, wintry winds, it covers itself with a cloak made of twigs and leaves."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"If its cloak is broken in battle, it quickly remakes the cloak with materials nearby."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Even if it is born where there are no cocooning materials, it somehow always ends up with a cloak."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It covers itself with a cloak to shelter from the cold. When it’s hot, its cloak is thinner."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It covers itself with a cloak to shelter from the cold. When it’s hot, its cloak is thinner."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Nul ne sait comment il y parvient, mais il arrive toujours à se former une cape, où qu’il soit."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Even if it is born where there are no cocooning materials, it somehow always ends up with a cloak."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Nul ne sait comment il y parvient, mais il arrive toujours à se former une cape, où qu’il soit."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Even if it is born where there are no cocooning materials, it somehow always ends up with a cloak."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Even if it is born where there are no cocooning materials, it somehow always ends up with a cloak."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Even if it is born where there are no cocooning materials, it somehow always ends up with a cloak."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Pour se protéger des vents glacés de l’hiver, il s’est tissé une cape de feuilles et de brindilles."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Para protegerse de los vientos fríos invernales, se cubre con un caparazón de ramas y hojas."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"To shelter itself 